{
 "name": "touch_grass",
 "about": "On one knee, leans out and lays his right hand on the grass, holds it there, comes back to the kneel. Held poses from a kneeling mocap clip. `hold` adds seconds with the hand down, so the hand can stay through a cut; `smile` 0 leaves the face alone, for a smile that belongs to the next shot `down` is the hand height above the mark, `reachFor` how long the hand takes to arrive, `open` how far the fingers curl while down (0 flat, 1 fist), `rise` when he is back up.",
